<td align="left" valign="top" class="em_center" style="font-family: 'Maitree', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 500;"><span class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_1"> 
<p><span style="font-size: 26px;">[<span style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Maitree, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 28px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">Virtual Q&amp;A</span>]</span></p> 
<p>New Improved&nbsp;Client Dashboard&nbsp;</p> 
</div> </span></td> 
