<table align="center" width="650" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="em_main_table mktoModule" id="Text_with_cta_section" style="width:650px; table-layout:fixed; background-color: #ffffff;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_padding2" style="padding: 35px 25px 50px;"> 
<table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_defaultlink" style="font-family: 'Maitree', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; color: #223341;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_3"></div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" height="20" style="height: 20px; font-size: 0px; line-height: 0px;">&nbsp;</td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_defaultlink" style="font-family: 'Chivo', 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: #223341;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_4"> 
<div> 
<p class="p1" style="text-align: left;">We hope you’ve been enjoying using the new dashboard over the past few months. We’ve been hard at work gathering feedback and making improvements to make it the best experience possible. If you haven’t already, please <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #48b895;"><strong><a href="https://dashboard-new.flywire.com/login?fromOldApp=true?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" title="Log in link" style="color: #48b895;"><span class="s1">log in</span></a></strong></span></span> to the new dashboard to access all of your cross-border international payment information.</p> 
<br /> 
</div> 
<div class="“p1”"> 
<p class="p1" style="text-align: left;">Please note that effective <b>June 2nd</b>, the former dashboard will be retired, and all users will be required to use the new dashboard. To aid this transition, we have changed the link in your daily disbursement emails to point directly to the new dashboard.</p> 
<br /> 
<p class="p2" style="text-align: left;">Learn more about the new dashboard <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #48b895; text-decoration: underline;"><strong><a href="https://dashboard-new.flywire.com/learn-more?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b895; text-decoration: underline;"><span class="s1">here</span></a></strong></span>,</span> and join one of our virtual Q&amp;A sessions to get all your dashboard questions answered!&nbsp;</p> 
<ul class="ul1" style="text-align: left;"> 
<li class="li2"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><span class="s2" style="color: #48b895;"><a href="https://more.flywire.com/NewClientDashboard-QASession.html?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b895;" title="Q&amp;A session link"><span class="s3">Session 1</span></a></span></strong></span>: May 19th at 8am PDT | 11am EDT | 4pm BST</span><br /></li> 
<li class="li2"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span class="s2"></span><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><a href="https://more.flywire.com/Webinar_NewClientDashboardAPACQASession.html" style="text-decoration: none; color: #48b985;" target="_blank"><span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Session 2</span></a></strong></span><span style="font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: </span></span>May 20th at 10am SGT, HKT, MST | 11am KST | 12pm AEST | 2pm NZST</span></li> 
</ul> 
</div> 
<div class="“p1”"> 
<div class="“p1”" style="text-align: left;"> 
<p class="p1">If you’re unable to join one of our Q&amp;A sessions, simply log in to our <span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985;"><a href="https://help.client.flywire.com/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;" target="_blank"><span class="s1"><b>Help Center</b></span></a></span> for additional resources, or contact your Relationship Manager with any questions.<span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;"></span></span><br /></p> 
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;"></span></span><br /></p> 
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">Best,</span></span></p> 
<p class="p1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">The Flywire Team</span></span></p> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
